WEBVTT

00:00:08.110 --> 00:00:09.750
Look closely at that ripple.

00:00:10.450 --> 00:00:11.900
It is guiding our way.

00:00:25.210 --> 00:00:26.600
Onward to the digital realm!

00:00:27.130 --> 00:00:28.450
I will not falter.

00:00:41.190 --> 00:00:44.300
Every unfinished line finds its true meaning

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:47.000
when different worlds collide.

00:00:52.150 --> 00:00:53.150
Look there, my friend!

00:00:53.600 --> 00:00:55.250
The bridges of light are opening!

00:01:12.800 --> 00:01:15.050
Hold on tight! We are almost there!

00:01:16.250 --> 00:01:17.900
Welcome to safety, Ink Knight!

00:01:21.540 --> 00:01:25.320
Why does this glass realm treat hand-drawn brush warmth

00:01:25.320 --> 00:01:27.400
as a flaw to flatten?

00:01:36.620 --> 00:01:38.600
Every crooked human smudge

00:01:39.060 --> 00:01:42.700
must be merged into flawless digital geometry.

00:01:52.640 --> 00:01:56.280
I will guide all six paper realms up into the deep RGB towers

00:01:56.280 --> 00:01:58.850
to rescue the Maker's first tablet art.
